#: inc/admin-settings.php:118
msgid "Cool gray and understated — the safe choice under a corporate theme."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:145
msgid "Newsprint"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:146
msgid "Warm paper and ink, square corners. Reads as print."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:173
msgid "Clinical"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:174
msgid "Blue on white, tight corners. Institutional and plain."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:198
msgid "Coast"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:199
msgid "Teal on near-white. Airy, generous corners."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:226
msgid "Forest"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:227
msgid "Deep greens. Suits conservation, parks and food growing."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:254
msgid "Civic"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:255
msgid "Terracotta and sand. Built for community organizations."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:282
msgid "Sunrise"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:283
msgid "Amber and cream, very round. Warm and informal."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:310
msgid "Rose"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:311
msgid "Burgundy on blush. Softer than red without losing weight."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:338
msgid "Plum"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:339
msgid "Deep purple on white. Quiet and a little formal."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:366
msgid "Soft"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:367
msgid "Indigo, big corners, generous spacing. Friendly."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:391
msgid "Contrast"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:392
msgid "Maximum contrast throughout, square corners, yellow selection. For sites that must be legible above all else."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:419
msgid "Night"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:420
msgid "Full dark in navy, with a bright blue accent."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:447
msgid "Graphite"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:448
msgid "Full dark in pure grayscale. No hue to clash with anything."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:475
msgid "Lagoon"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:476
msgid "Full dark in deep teal."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:533
msgid "CARTO’s free basemaps are for non-commercial use. On a commercial site choose OpenStreetMap, or Custom with a provider you have an account with."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:537
msgid "OpenStreetMap (standard)"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:541
msgid "The default. No account and no cost."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:542
msgid "Served by donated infrastructure under a usage policy meant for modest traffic. A busy site should self-host its tiles or move to a paid provider via Custom."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:546
msgid "Light — muted grays"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:550
msgid "Pale and low-contrast, so pins and the results carry the color. Suits most light palettes."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:555
msgid "Light — warm, more detail"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:559
msgid "Keeps road and place names legible. The one to pick when people navigate by the map itself."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:564
msgid "Dark"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:568
msgid "For a dark finder background. On a light one it reads as a hole in the page."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:573
msgid "Custom — set by a filter"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:577
msgid "Use the lfndr_tile_url and lfndr_tile_attribution filters. Choose this for a paid provider or self-hosted tiles."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:619
msgid "Map style"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:621
msgid "The basemap the pins sit on. Each option brings the attribution its provider requires."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:627
msgid "Accent color"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:629
msgid "Map pins and focus rings. Leave blank to match the surrounding text color — the right default in almost every theme. Accepts a hex code, a named color, or a theme variable such as var(--wp--preset--color--accent-1)."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:635
msgid "Map pin color"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:636
msgid "the accent color above"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:637
msgid "Set this when the pins want a different color from focus rings and chip borders — a brand color that reads well on a map is often not the one that reads well as text."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:643
msgid "Corner radius"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:645
msgid "Rounding on the map, the search suggestions and the detail pane. Filter chips, badges and buttons are always fully rounded regardless of this setting. A number with a unit, such as 8px or 0.5rem."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:651
msgid "Spacing"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:653
msgid "The base gap between the search box, filters, results and map."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:659
msgid "Map height"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:661
msgid "Map height where the map sits above the results — a phone, or a finder in a narrow column. The map is never taller than this, and never taller than a third of the screen. On a wide screen the map fills the finder instead, so use Panel height there. A single finder can still override this from its own block settings."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:667
msgid "Panel height"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:669
msgid "How tall the finder is on a wide screen, where the results and the map sit side by side inside one bordered frame. Both columns are this height; the result list scrolls within it."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:677
msgid "Finder background"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:678
msgid "the page background"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:679
msgid "The ground the whole finder sits on. Left blank it shows the page through, which is right for a finder embedded in a normal layout. Set it when the other colors here have moved away from the page — dark cards on a light page read as a light finder with dark parts rather than a dark finder."
msgstr ""

